## 3. RELIGION SYSTEM

### 3.1 Add Religious Depth Beyond "Holy War" (CRITICAL)

**Current Problem:**
- 98.8% of wars are holy wars
- 168 religions founded, 162 extinct
- All religions have near-identical creeds
- No doctrinal variation affects behaviour

**Proposed Solutions:**

#### A. Doctrinal Axes System
```
NEW: Each religion has positions on 5 doctrinal axes:

AXIS               | VALUES                | EFFECTS
-------------------|-----------------------|--------------------------------
Militarism         | Pacifist ←→ Crusader  | War eagerness, battle morale
Tolerance          | Exclusive ←→ Syncretic| Conversion vs. coexistence
Asceticism         | Material ←→ Spiritual | Economic focus, specialist rates
Authority          | Hierarchical ←→ Egalitarian | Political structure
Afterlife Focus    | This World ←→ Next World | Risk tolerance, birth rates

EXAMPLE RELIGIONS:
"Servants of Greothwosism" might be:
  Militarism: 70 (Crusader)
  Tolerance: 20 (Exclusive)
  Asceticism: 40 (Balanced)
  Authority: 80 (Hierarchical)
  Afterlife: 60 (Slightly otherworldly)

This creates MEANINGFUL religious variation:
- Two pacifist religions would rarely war
- A syncretic religion could absorb others peacefully
- Hierarchical religions create different politics
```

#### B. Religious Syncretism Mechanic
```
NEW: Religions can merge instead of only going extinct

SYNCRETISM CONDITIONS:
- Two religions coexist in same tribe for >500 days
- Both have Tolerance > 50
- Combined followers > minimum threshold

SYNCRETISM OUTCOME:
- New religion created with averaged doctrines
- Followers of both parent religions convert
- Parent religions marked "absorbed" (not extinct)
- Cultural achievement unlocked

This gives an ALTERNATIVE to holy war for religious interaction
```

#### C. Religious Institutions
```
NEW: Religions can build institutions as they grow

INSTITUTION UNLOCKS (by follower count):
| Followers | Institution        | Effect                              |
|-----------|--------------------|-------------------------------------|
| 50        | Shrine             | +5% happiness for followers         |
| 200       | Temple             | +10% conversion rate                |
| 500       | Monastery          | +specialist generation rate         |
| 1000      | Cathedral          | +20% morale in battles              |
| 2000      | Holy Order         | Military unit available             |
| 5000      | Religious Center   | Era progress bonus                  |

Institutions are DESTROYED on conquest or religious suppression
This creates STAKES for religious conflict
```

