## 15. LOGGING SYSTEM OVERHAUL (CRITICAL - DQ-1, DQ-2, DQ-3)

### 15.1 Canonical Time System

```
CURRENT PROBLEM: Three different clocks (day, frame, clock_frame)
PROPOSED: Single canonical time

IMPLEMENTATION:
class CanonicalTime:
    frame: int           # Master clock (never reset)
    day: int             # Derived: frame / FRAMES_PER_DAY
    year: int            # Derived: day / DAYS_PER_YEAR
    era_day: int         # Days since last era change

    def to_string(self):
        return f"Y{self.year}D{self.day}F{self.frame}"

ALL LOG ENTRIES MUST INCLUDE:
{
    "t": {
        "frame": 298136,
        "day": 4950,
        "year": 13,
        "era": "Medieval",
        "era_day": 234
